WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:05.932
Report cards

00:00:05.982 --> 00:00:09.441
Open Academics, then Report Cards.

00:00:13.525 --> 00:00:16.709
Choose a class, then pick a student.

00:00:25.765 --> 00:00:29.064
You can also filter by session and exams.

00:00:29.525 --> 00:00:33.754
The preview shows exam results, grades and GPA.

00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:41.318
Press Download PDF for a printable report card.

00:00:43.605 --> 00:00:48.282
Ready to print
